<content><![CDATA[<p>HAX began in teaching and learning, so many blocks check understanding, not just show content. Answer these; the theme keeps track of what you finish.</p>
<h2>Check what you know</h2>
<true-false-question question="Every block on this page also works outside of the HAX editor."><input type="checkbox" value="True" data-correct="true"><input type="checkbox" value="False"></true-false-question>
<multiple-choice question="Which of these can you add to a HAX page?" correct-text="Yes, all of them." incorrect-text="Not quite: try another." check-label="Check answer" reset-label="Reset"><input type="checkbox" value="A video"><input type="checkbox" value="A quiz"><input type="checkbox" value="A data table"><input type="checkbox" value="A pixel-art character"></multiple-choice>
<mark-the-words question="Select every web component name in this sentence" statement="Add a video-player and a grid-plate to the page." max-attempts="0"><input type="checkbox" value="video-player"><input type="checkbox" value="grid-plate"></mark-the-words>
<h2>Lay things out</h2>
<grid-plate layout="1-1">
  <div slot="col-1">
    <h3>Two columns</h3>
    <p>This is a <code>grid-plate</code>. Drag blocks between its columns or pick another layout in its settings.</p>
  </div>
  <div slot="col-2">
    <rpg-character seed="try-hax" walking=""></rpg-character>
    <p>And this is <a href="https://rpg-me.hax.cloud">rpg-character</a>. Build your own at RPG me.</p>
  </div>
</grid-plate>
<h2>Show data</h2>
<editable-table bordered="" striped="" column-header="">
  <table>
    <caption>Blocks on this page</caption>
    <tbody><tr><th>Block</th><th>What it does</th></tr>
    <tr><td>true-false-question</td><td>A quick true or false check</td></tr>
    <tr><td>multiple-choice</td><td>One or more correct answers</td></tr>
    <tr><td>mark-the-words</td><td>Pick the right words in a sentence</td></tr>
    <tr><td>grid-plate</td><td>Columns for any blocks</td></tr>
    <tr><td>editable-table</td><td>This table, sortable and editable</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
</editable-table>
<p>See every block, with demos, in the <a href="https://webcomponents.hax.cloud">element portfolio</a>.</p>]]></content>
